  "body": "Adds a Windows Chrome 155 profile with the matching UA, Client Hints brand order and navigation Accept header (including image/jxl). It reuses Chrome 154's TLS/HTTP2 settings, including sorted trust anchors, based on local Windows Chrome 155.0.8059.40 initial-handshake captures. Other platforms, resumption and HTTP3 have not been validated.\n\nExtends the existing trust-anchor unit and loopback tests. The same profile compiled in a native consumer wheel and passed local initial TLS/H2/header comparisons; formatting and diff checks pass. Cargo tests were not run locally because the available Rust 1.94.1 is below the repository's 1.98 MSRV.\n",
